<title>USA: U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA soyoil weekly export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Sales of 15,400 MT were mainly the result of increases for unknown destinations (13,300 MT) and the United Arab Emirates (1,700 MT).</p>
<p>Exports of 35,500 MT were primarily to China (30,000 MT) and the Congo (3,500 MT).</p>
</text>
